# 行尾统一：仓库内一律存 LF
# 本文件优先级高于任何机器的 core.autocrlf，两台机器无需各自配置
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制，禁止任何行尾转换
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.so binary
